From d69c7b3469267a1b33bc28397034b1837bb5b206 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 10:33:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] storage: USB disk panel on Long-Term Storage - info, health
 scan, format, eject (networkmap side-menu migration)

Always-visible USB Disks card under the storage selections on
Reaper_Storage.asp, replacing the networkmap USB icon side menu so that
page can be retired (separate pass). Per connected disk: name/port/total,
per-partition fs + used/total bar, and four actions - Health Scanner
(start_diskscan + diskmon_status poll + disk_fsck.xml results), Format
(start_diskformat, fs choice gated on usb_ntfs_mod/usb_hfs_mod, sanitized
label, double confirm), Safely Remove (safely_remove_disk ej). Disk that
holds the long-term store gets a badge. Stock backends only - no new CGI;
inventory via get_usb_info SSI + appGet refresh. Reaper theme (btn2
outline buttons, crimson usage bars), rule-29 backtick tokens, reuses
stock disk tokens + new RDST_43..47 in all 25 dicts (6190 -> 6195
lockstep, EN-seeded; translation pass rides the i18n-residuals item).
Also removes an untracked www/temp.dict (junk; would stage into image).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
